### Topic 46 - the Book API under test (VS Code "REST Client": click "Send Request")
### The real star of this topic is "mvn test" - but you can also play with the API.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### All books (3 sample books from DataSeeder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### One book
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1

### Create -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "author": "Martin Fowler",
  "isbn": "978-0134757599",
  "price": 499.00
}

### Same ISBN again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code (copy)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0132350884",
  "price": 1
}

### Invalid body -> 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "isbn": "1",
  "price": -1
}

### 10 % discount
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1/discount?percent=10

### Too big discount -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1/discount?percent=80

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/3

### Unknown -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999
